   "extract": "Susan L. Wiles is an American Republican political consultant and lobbyist who served as the 32nd White House chief of staff from 2025 to 2026, the first woman to hold the position.",
   "extract_html": "<p><b>Susan L. Wiles</b> is an American Republican political consultant and lobbyist who served as the 32nd White House chief of staff from 2025 to 2026, the first woman to hold the position.</p>"
